  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      273.17,
      401.84,
      298.31
    ],
    "text": "Be it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      314.57,
      401.86,
      339.71
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Land (Restrictions onAlienation) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      355.97,
      401.88,
      408.71
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 3 of the Land (Restrictions on Alienation)Act, No. 38 of 2014 is hereby amended in subsection (1) bythe repeal of paragraph (i) and the substitution therefor ofthe following paragraph:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.29,
      421.97,
      401.86,
      469.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(i)any land, the title of which is transferred, to acompany referred to in paragraph (b) of subsection(1) of section 2, listed in the Colombo StockExchange.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      481.97,
      401.86,
      517.31
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between theSinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shallprevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
